WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.831
A pivot can be planned with four decisions First
define the output

00:00:05.858 --> 00:00:11.504
row grain Second identify the category values that
should become

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:17.521
columns Third choose the measure Fourth

00:00:17.692 --> 00:00:23.553
choose the aggregate needed to fill each cell For
the diagnosis example one

00:00:23.579 --> 00:00:28.671
output row is one month the categories are diagnoses
and the measure is admission count
